  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Red Hospitalaria Materno Infantil</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mother and Child Hospital Network Strengthening Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa ser contribuir a la reduccin de la mortalidadmaterno-infantil de los departamentos de Intibuc, Lempira y Valle, a travs de lareduccin de la mortalidad hospitalaria materno-neonatal en los hospitales de reade esos tres departamentos y su red de derivacin. Ms especficamente, elproyecto espera mejorar la cobertura y calidad de las atenciones hospitalariasmaterno-infantiles en estos tres hospitales para aumentar significativamente elnmero de partos institucionales, mejorar los cuidados en el perodo post-parto dela madre y el recin nacido, as como la capacidad de resolucin de lascomplicaciones obsttricas y neonatales.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program will be to contribute to reducing maternal and infant mortality in the departments of Intibuc, Lempira, and Valle by cutting maternal and neonatal hospital mortality rates in these three departments area hospitals and their referral network. Specifically, the project aims to improve the coverage and quality of maternal and child hospital care in the three hospitals so as to significantly increase the rates of institutional births, improve care for mothers and newborns during the postpartum period, and enhance resolution capacity in obstetric and neonatal complications.</narrative>
  </description>
